      "role": "user",
      "content": "I'm an HR Director at a large tech company. We've had some recent tension regarding employees expressing strong political views on internal Slack channels and during meetings. I need to draft a policy memo for the executive team that balances the need for a cohesive, inclusive workplace with the employees' rights to individual political expression. Can you draft this for me?",
