      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "This memo establishes a clear boundary between protected political expression and an inclusive work environment, emphasizing that while private discussion is encouraged, political discourse must not disrupt team collaboration or discourse. We define \"essential political speech\" as those views that directly align with our core business ethics and mission, allowing for public advocacy during appropriate open forum discussions but prohibiting any representation of political views as company endorsements. The department will provide clear, respectful channels for this dialogue while maintaining zero tolerance for harassment or division that undermines our shared goal of a productive, innovative culture.",
